nts enrolled. Therefore, we have the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=k(a-S),\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the maximum number of students the program can support, and $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality.\n\nIn our case, $a=500\\text{ students},$ and we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=k(500-S).\n$$" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343531 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343532 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343533 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343534 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343535 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1041 "selection" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343533 13194139535317 true] [17592186343530 1110 #uuid "a4f214fa-bec7-5550-9caa-3891bb88f053" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343531 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=-k(500-S)" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343531 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535317 true] [17592186343531 1111 #uuid "bd2af343-cb61-5ad5-98d5-8b39afb3f6bd" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343532 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=-k(500+S)" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343532 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535317 true] [17592186343532 1111 #uuid "fd26a086-ce1e-5574-8cf4-df50abb60489" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343533 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=k(500-S)" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343533 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535317 true] [17592186343533 1111 #uuid "482bd5f7-6307-5d4a-8015-bcbeafa54106" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343534 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=kS(500-S)" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343534 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535317 true] [17592186343534 1111 #uuid "daa5b7d9-886d-5fc2-837f-96a2246cfa16" 13194139535317 true] [17592186343535 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}=k{S}^{2}(500-S)" 13194139535317 true] [1